  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/thirteenth-amendment> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The 1865 amendment to the U.S. Constitution that abolished slavery and involuntary servitude throughout the United States, except as punishment for a crime, and gave Congress power to enforce that ban." .
